responses=['May the Lord bless you from Zion, the creator of heaven and earth.','O Lord, our Master, how mighty is Thy Name over the whole earth.','Protect me, O Lord, for I trust in Thee.','May God be gracious to us and bless us, may He cause His countenance to shine with us, Selah.','The Lord, the Lord is a merciful and gracious God, slow to anger and great in kindness and truth.','Turn towards me and be gracious to me for I am alone and poor.','Towards Thee, O Lord, I lift up my soul.','Behold just as the eyes of slaves are on the hand of their master and as the eyes of the handmaid are on the hand of her mistress, so are our eyes on the Lord our God until He will be gracious to us.','May he receive blessing from the Lord and kindness from the God of his salvation and find grace and favour in the eyes of God and man.','O Lord, be gracious to us, to Thee we hope, be their strength every morning as well as our help in time of trouble.']
